** 010 Component States

*** 010.010 Intro.md
# Button Lab

A tiny starter notebook for previewing UI states with built-in Astryx primitives.

*** 010.020 BasicButton.html
<ax-card>
  <ax-badge>Button</ax-badge>
  <ax-title>Primary Action</ax-title>
  <ax-text>This is a clean default button state.</ax-text>
  <ax-row>
    <ax-button>Save changes</ax-button>
    <ax-button variant="ghost">Cancel</ax-button>
  </ax-row>
</ax-card>

*** 010.030 ButtonGroup.html
<ax-card>
  <ax-badge>Variants</ax-badge>
  <ax-title>Button Group</ax-title>
  <ax-stack>
    <ax-row>
      <ax-button>Primary</ax-button>
      <ax-button variant="ghost">Ghost</ax-button>
    </ax-row>
    <ax-muted>Later this becomes a real props/state matrix.</ax-muted>
  </ax-stack>
</ax-card>

